# Four Torches: The Crypts, our own levels (CC BY-SA 4.0). 44 x 30 tiles each; a level starts with "== NAME", then
# "rank N" (how strong its generators begin, 1-3), then the rows. After the last one, levels are generated.
#   #  wall              %  wall that crumbles when shot      .  floor          D  door (a key opens it)
#   @  start             E  exit                              X  exit that skips a level
#   1  bone pile (ghosts)    2  hut (grunts)    3  brazier (imps)
#   g r i s z d  a ghost, grunt, imp, skeleton, sorcerer, deathshade waiting
#   f b c  ham, bowl, cider (food)    k  key    p  potion    $  chest    *  gold

